# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Radiator Routes — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every integration is either FREE (no key) or FREE-TIER (free key, no card).
# Only the Supabase pair is required; everything else degrades gracefully.
#
#   cp .env.example .env
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase — REQUIRED (auth, database, realtime) ───────────────────────────
# Free tier: 500 MB DB, 50k MAU, 5 GB bandwidth.
# https://supabase.com → New Project → Project Settings → API
# The app throws on startup in dev if these are missing.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project.supabase.co"
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY="your-supabase-publishable-key"

# Optional alias, read only if VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY is unset.
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_DEFAULT_KEY=""

# ── Groq LLM — OPTIONAL (recommended) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Free tier: ~1M+ tokens/day, no credit card.
# https://console.groq.com
# Powers: Jinny chat, AI itinerary planning, regret planner, travel memory,
#         camera scene description (accessibility).
# Without it those features show an "AI unavailable" notice; the rest works.
VITE_GROQ_API_KEY=""

# ── OpenRouteService — OPTIONAL (routing & elevation) ────────────────────────
# Free tier: 2000 requests/day, no credit card.
# https://openrouteservice.org → Sign up → Dashboard → Create Token
# Without it: turn-by-turn directions and climate-aware routes are disabled.
VITE_ORS_API_KEY=""

# ── OpenTripMap — OPTIONAL (place / POI discovery) ───────────────────────────
# Free tier: 1000 requests/day, no credit card.
# https://opentripmap.io/product
# Without it: Explore falls back to curated destinations.
VITE_OPENTRIPMAP_API_KEY=""

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No key required for these — used automatically:
#   Open-Meteo (weather) · Nominatim + OpenStreetMap (geocoding & tiles)
#   MapLibre GL (3D maps) · Wikipedia / Wikimedia (place context & imagery)
#   Web Speech API (voice input & text-to-speech, browser-native)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# REMOVED — these paid services were replaced by free alternatives.
# Setting them has no effect.
#   VITE_AMADEUS_API_KEY / VITE_AMADEUS_API_SECRET
#       → free deep-links (Google Flights, Kiwi, Skyscanner, Booking.com)
#   VITE_TRAFFIC_API_KEY (TomTom)
#       → time-of-day traffic estimation + Nominatim + ORS
#   VITE_MAPPLS_FRONTEND_KEY / VITE_MAPPLS_BACKEND_KEY
#       → OpenStreetMap + MapLibre GL
#   GNews (was hardcoded in source)
#       → Wikipedia REST + curated travel advisories
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
